2026-10-09T18:47:26.2880683Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc ? chainlesschain ? clc ? clchain</code>) and
2026-10-09T18:47:26.3244865Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-09T18:47:26.3319456Z         <br/><br/>
