2026-10-09T18:47:26.3871769Z         Requires <code>cc</code> ? 0.162.95.
2026-10-09T18:47:26.3895976Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.3902864Z         <b>0.4.24</b> � fix: a graceful "couldn't ask in the panel" degradation no
