2026-10-09T18:47:26.6299266Z         Verifier reported on 2026.x: the @-mention list renderer no longer uses a
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6300240Z         scheduled-for-removal helper, and the deprecated terminal customizer was
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6301244Z         removed (a <code>cc</code> you run in a terminal still auto-connects via the
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6302018Z         bridge's discovery lockfile).
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6302471Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6303188Z         <b>0.4.6</b> � newer-IDE compatibility: removed the last deprecated-API
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6304164Z         usages (terminal-process listener + provider-chooser dialog). Plugin Verifier
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6305241Z         reports no internal / scheduled-for-removal / deprecated API usage on 2025.2.
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6306206Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6341928Z         <b>0.4.5</b> � reverted the experimental 0.4.4 <code>getTerminalOutput</code>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6343342Z         tool: the terminal API it used is not stable across IDE versions and caused
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6344340Z         errors on some builds. Everything else is unchanged from 0.4.3.
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6344996Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6345752Z         <b>0.4.3</b> � the <code>@</code>-mention symbol completion now covers
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6346779Z         <b>methods/functions</b> too (not just classes) � type a method name to
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6347552Z         reference the file where it's defined.
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6348044Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6348789Z         <b>0.4.2</b> � the <code>@</code>-mention popup now includes project class
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6349723Z         symbols (type a class name to reference the file where it's defined),
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6350700Z         alongside <code>@selection</code>/<code>@diagnostics</code> and files.
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6351382Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6352536Z         <b>0.4.1</b> � expanded the plugin description / what's-new (no functional
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6353254Z         change since 0.4.0).
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6353662Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6354196Z         <b>0.4.0</b> � VS Code feature parity.
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6354660Z         <ul>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6355349Z           <li>Multi-conversation <b>tabs</b> (one agent per tab, resume across restarts).</li>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6356611Z           <li><b>Approval modes</b> (<code>/auto</code>�<code>/bypass</code>�<code>/normal</code>)
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6357947Z               and <b>extended thinking</b> (<code>/think</code>�<code>/ultrathink</code>�<code>/think-off</code>),
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6359468Z               plus <code>/new</code> <code>/stop</code> <code>/cost</code> <code>/context</code>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6360429Z               <code>/plan</code> <code>/approve</code> <code>/reject</code>.</li>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6361358Z           <li><b>Interactive plan &amp; approval cards</b> (Approve/Deny buttons).</li>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6362542Z           <li>Editor <b>Explain / Refactor</b> actions, <code>@file#L</code> reference
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6363577Z               insertion (<code>Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+K</code>), and an <code>@</code>-mention popup.</li>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6364818Z           <li>Native diff "<b>Request changes�</b>" with inline notes, and batch
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6365779Z               <b>openMultiDiff</b> multi-file review.</li>
2026-10-09T18:47:26.6366508Z           <li><b>In-editor app preview</b> (JCEF) with Start/Stop.</li>
