2026-10-09T18:51:52.5267375Z         bridge's discovery lockfile).
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5267906Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5268803Z         <b>0.4.6</b> � newer-IDE compatibility: removed the last deprecated-API
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5270192Z         usages (terminal-process listener + provider-chooser dialog). Plugin Verifier
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5271324Z         reports no internal / scheduled-for-removal / deprecated API usage on 2025.2.
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5272094Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5272891Z         <b>0.4.5</b> � reverted the experimental 0.4.4 <code>getTerminalOutput</code>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5274227Z         tool: the terminal API it used is not stable across IDE versions and caused
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5275382Z         errors on some builds. Everything else is unchanged from 0.4.3.
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5276378Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5277074Z         <b>0.4.3</b> � the <code>@</code>-mention symbol completion now covers
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5278111Z         <b>methods/functions</b> too (not just classes) � type a method name to
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5278948Z         reference the file where it's defined.
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5279504Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5280377Z         <b>0.4.2</b> � the <code>@</code>-mention popup now includes project class
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5281379Z         symbols (type a class name to reference the file where it's defined),
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5283519Z         alongside <code>@selection</code>/<code>@diagnostics</code> and files.
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5284996Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5285822Z         <b>0.4.1</b> � expanded the plugin description / what's-new (no functional
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5286552Z         change since 0.4.0).
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5287300Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5288134Z         <b>0.4.0</b> � VS Code feature parity.
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5288715Z         <ul>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5291195Z           <li>Multi-conversation <b>tabs</b> (one agent per tab, resume across restarts).</li>
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5292787Z           <li><b>Approval modes</b> (<code>/auto</code>�<code>/bypass</code>�<code>/normal</code>)
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5294154Z               and <b>extended thinking</b> (<code>/think</code>�<code>/ultrathink</code>�<code>/think-off</code>),
2026-10-09T18:51:52.5296220Z               plus <code>/new</code> <code>/stop</code> <code>/cost</code> <code>/context</code>
