2026-10-09T19:02:14.8981687Z         <b>0.4.29 / 0.4.30</b> � fix: <b>"Configure LLM" now pre-fills your config</b>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.8988994Z         � no more re-typing model+key. The wizard pre-fills your current model, base
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9027644Z         URL and vision model, pre-selects your current provider (? ??), and lets you
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9099671Z         <b>leave the API key blank to keep the stored one</b> (only required when there's
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9108650Z         no key yet or you switch providers). The config itself was never lost � it lives
