2026-10-09T19:02:14.9123310Z         wizard just didn't pre-fill it. (Mirrors the VS Code 0.34.0 fix. 0.4.30 adds
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9131663Z         this very change-note, which 0.4.29 omitted.)
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9146640Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9154853Z         <b>0.4.28</b> � docs: the Marketplace "What's New" now lists every release
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9168716Z         (it had silently stopped at 0.4.19 � change-notes are no longer missed).
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9181375Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9187030Z         <b>0.4.27</b> � cleared the 2 deprecated-API usages the Marketplace verifier
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9204487Z         flagged (now <code>URI.toURL()</code> + a combo-box dialog), so the plugin
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9206838Z         stays compatible with future IntelliJ releases.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9209446Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9231274Z         <b>0.4.26</b> � fix: no more false "???? cc CLI" when <code>cc</code> IS
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9262977Z         installed. The version probe timeout went 5s ? 12s (cold starts), and since
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9358117Z         <code>cc</code> is also the C compiler's name, the plugin now resolves the
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9422118Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc ? chainlesschain ? clc ? clchain</code>) and
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9474986Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9532860Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9623166Z         <b>0.4.25</b> � the agent can actually ask you a question:
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9632691Z         <code>ask_user_question</code> now pops a dialog (single-choice / multi-select
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9658471Z         checkboxes / free-text input) so the agent can clarify instead of guessing.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9662362Z         Requires <code>cc</code> ? 0.162.95.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9663816Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9669158Z         <b>0.4.24</b> � fix: a graceful "couldn't ask in the panel" degradation no
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9672229Z         longer renders as a scary <b>? ask_user_question</b> failure.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9673591Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9675749Z         <b>0.4.23</b> � new <b>? LLM ? ?? cc ??�</b> menu item (check on demand),
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9677718Z         plus a clear hint when the <code>cc</code> CLI isn't installed.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9684360Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9685912Z         <b>0.4.22</b> � you're now told when a newer <code>cc</code> CLI is published
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9690880Z         on npm, so you don't silently miss new features.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9706556Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9713420Z         <b>0.4.21</b> � fix: reconfiguring the LLM now restarts the running chat so it
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9715878Z         picks up the new provider/model/key (no more "?????? / ??????").
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9757880Z         <br/><br/>
