2026-10-09T19:02:14.9914507Z         <code>cc agent --image</code> uses.
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9923660Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9944138Z         <b>0.4.18</b> � dedicated image-recognition (vision) model entry: the
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9953404Z         <b>? LLM</b> button is now a small menu (configure full LLM <i>or</i> just
2026-10-09T19:02:14.9970452Z         the vision model), plus a <b>Tools ? Configure Vision Model</b> action.
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0065324Z         Set <code>llm.visionModel</code> without re-running the whole wizard or
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0095975Z         re-typing your API key; blank reverts to the text model.
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0118796Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0137139Z         <b>0.4.17</b> � first-run nudge: when no LLM provider is configured yet,
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0175603Z         the chat panel now shows a dim hint pointing at the <b>? LLM</b> button
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0208704Z         instead of staying blank until the first turn fails with a 401 (VS Code
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0236909Z         onboarding parity).
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0267511Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0369139Z         <b>0.4.16</b> � chat panel LLM UX: (1) paste screenshots � Ctrl/Cmd+V an
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0465349Z         image to attach it to your next message (vision); (2) a <b>? LLM</b>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0490526Z         quick-entry button by Send opens the provider/model wizard, and auth
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0522667Z         failures (401/403/missing key) now hint at it; (3) the wizard can set a
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0524676Z         separate <b>image-recognition (vision) model</b> � text and vision models
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0527982Z         no longer have to be the same.
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0530988Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0536427Z         <b>0.4.15</b> � multi-line chat composer: the input now wraps across
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0548323Z         lines � <b>Enter</b> sends, <b>Shift+Enter</b> adds a newline (VS Code
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0562106Z         parity).
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0567857Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0568723Z         <b>0.4.14</b> � extended-thinking reasoning (with <code>/think</code>) now
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0572593Z         streams into the transcript dimmed/italic, set apart from the answer
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0573339Z         (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0573793Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0574901Z         <b>0.4.13</b> � Markdown rendering in the chat transcript: fenced/inline
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0575870Z         <code>code</code> (monospace) and <b>bold</b> now render instead of raw
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0576824Z         markers (VS Code parity). Streaming stays plain, then snaps to styled.
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0577466Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0578157Z         <b>0.4.12</b> � "Fix with ChainlessChain" intention: on an error/warning
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0584085Z         line, Alt+Enter offers a quick-fix that seeds the chat with a fix request
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0587765Z         scoped to that file + those problems (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0588397Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0589703Z         <b>0.4.11</b> � slash-command autocomplete: typing <code>/</code> at the
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0598005Z         start of the chat input pops a chooser of the panel's commands
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0600192Z         (<code>/new</code>, <code>/compact</code>, <code>/think</code>, �),
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0602163Z         filtered as you type (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0603295Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0604863Z         <b>0.4.10</b> � fix: wrap the diff-review document reads
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0606387Z         (<code>openDiff</code>/<code>openMultiDiff</code>) in a read action.
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0609765Z         Since 2026.2 the EDT no longer grants implicit read access, so building
