2026-10-09T19:02:15.0625902Z         2026.2+. No behavior change on 2025.x.
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0647431Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0648428Z         <b>0.4.9</b> � fix: the chat tool window now deterministically uses the
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0655864Z         LLM provider you configured (<code>cc config</code> / Configure LLM),
