2026-10-09T19:02:15.0667315Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0669171Z         <b>0.4.8</b> � <code>/compact</code> in the chat tool window (Claude-Code
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0670186Z         IDE parity): trims the live conversation history between turns (no extra
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0672217Z         LLM call) and reports the tokens saved. Mirrors the VS Code 0.31.0
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0690451Z         feature.
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0703678Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:02:15.0708964Z         <b>0.4.7</b> � cleared the remaining API-compatibility flags the Plugin
