2026-10-09T19:04:13.8430669Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc ? chainlesschain ? clc ? clchain</code>) and
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8431761Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8432355Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8433087Z         <b>0.4.25</b> � the agent can actually ask you a question:
