2026-10-09T19:04:13.8436051Z         Requires <code>cc</code> ? 0.162.95.
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8437185Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8437973Z         <b>0.4.24</b> � fix: a graceful "couldn't ask in the panel" degradation no
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8438859Z         longer renders as a scary <b>? ask_user_question</b> failure.
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8439459Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T19:04:13.8440304Z         <b>0.4.23</b> � new <b>? LLM ? ?? cc ??�</b> menu item (check on demand),
